RIS Legal MCP Server adaptation
===============================
Source: https://github.com/mburgler/ris-mcp-worker
Upstream commit: a99b4fe7d283dc896ecb68e76e1b81c1985a02af
Upstream package: ris-legal-mcp-server 0.2.0
License declared by the upstream package.json and README: Apache-2.0.

LegalWork adapts the upstream eight tool input/output schemas, application
mappings, RIS query translation, citation building and tool handlers.
Modifications by Eigenwelt Labs include native integration dispatch, opt-in
activation, organization policy, a shared cancellable request queue without
a response cache, bounded official-endpoint-only fetching, isolated document
conversion, stricter validation, date handling and explicit failure reporting.

